{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-27b","no":"EP.27B","tag":"第27話 番外 · 留下的人","title":"留下的人","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-27b:1","s":"n","t":"門開啟前夜，店燈全熄，只有爐子低低呼吸。","bg":"jae","tone":"dark","bgm":"destinyRoom","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:2","s":"n","t":"閏月獨坐爐前，膝上黃紙與筆，腕口蔓延的洞纏著三層繃帶。","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"base"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27b:3","s":"yun","t":"來，客人。今天最後一單生意了。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:4","s":"n","t":"沒有客人。自人們開始忘記他，一半的話便成自語，他已習慣。"},{"id":"ep-27b:5","s":"n","t":"筆寫下小姐的日柱乙亥，周圍畫八顆小星，留空最後一顆。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:6","s":"yun","t":"符只用一次，力量才最強。想著用兩次，就會沾上貪心。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:7","s":"n","t":"他把符迎向火光，滿意點頭。"},{"id":"ep-27b:8","s":"yun","t":"引路符，替小姐照亮一次回來的路。沒有有效期，不退款。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27b:9","s":"neo","t":"在那兒幹什麼？","x":"serious","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"surprise"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-27b:10","s":"yun","t":"哎喲，貓先生。客服晚上也巡邏啊。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27b:11","s":"neo","t":"聞著味道來的。墨的味道。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:12","s":"n","t":"Neo看他手裡的符，又看下方繃帶，末端滲出黑斑。"},{"id":"ep-27b:13","s":"neo","t":"那是給Yeoni的？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:14","s":"yun","t":"明早偷偷放進麵包袋。親手給她，她會道謝，我大概會哭。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:15","s":"neo","t":"你不會哭。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-27b:16","s":"yun","t":"貓先生太不瞭解我。我很愛哭，只是大家把這也忘了。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27b:17","s":"n","t":"Neo不答，坐到他旁邊，一起看了很久爐火。","bgm":"gloom","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:18","s":"neo","t":"你早就知道，自己過不了那扇門？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:19","s":"yun","t":"從初到這世界就這樣。沒時辰回不去，三年裡，倒也兩次走到那門前。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:20","s":"neo","t":"兩次都……","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:21","s":"yun","t":"嗯。兩次，門都沒認出我。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27b:r3-lost","s":"yun","t":"起初不是一個人。還有個人同日收到應用，可先消失了。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27b:r5-late","s":"yun","t":"去找的時候已經遲了。我總是晚一步。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:22","s":"n","t":"爐中一根柴塌下，火星飛起。他用纏繃帶的手一握，火星被掌洞吸去。","im":true,"fx":"fire","sfx":"fire","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:23","s":"neo","t":"那邊，我守在Yeoni身邊。你在這裡撐住。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:24","s":"yun","t":"當然。別的不好說，硬撐我最在行。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:25","s":"neo","t":"還有，謝謝，昨夜河上的事。","x":"soft"},{"id":"ep-27b:26","s":"yun","t":"哇，貓先生道謝了。寫成符賣，一定大發。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27b:27","s":"neo","t":"收回。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27b:28","s":"n","t":"第二天早上，門開了。金色的風充滿了麵包店的倉庫。","bg":"tarotDoor","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:29","s":"n","t":"小姐跨門檻時，他輕念一個名字，那個不叫閏月的名字，盼過門的人或許捎走。","im":true,"fx":"flash","sfx":"door","shot":"close","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"sad"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"flash","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:30","s":"n","t":"風蓋過聲音。小姐似回頭，門卻已經關了。"},{"id":"ep-27b:31","s":"yun","t":"果然還是勉強嗎。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27b:32","s":"n","t":"門又成舊倉庫門，一切比想象快。他站了許久，撫過門柄，仍暖。","im":true,"shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"tarotDoor","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotDoor","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotDoor 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:33","s":"n","t":"中午摩卡收行李，不過一捆烤串鐵籤，與昨日裝滿的火罐。","bg":"jae","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:34","s":"moka","t":"那我走了，去祭典島。趁火未冷得上船。","x":"base","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"base"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-27b:35","s":"yun","t":"水獺先生，多保重。饒舌也少來點。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:36","s":"moka","t":"說唱不減。騙子，想寒酸就來祭典島寒酸。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27b:36b","s":"moka","t":"來了坐火邊，烤串會給你。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:37","s":"yun","t":"免費？","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27b:38","s":"moka","t":"賒帳。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-27b:39","s":"n","t":"摩卡抱火罐跑向碼頭，一次未回頭。閏月便安心揮手，直到水獺尾巴消失巷尾。"},{"id":"ep-27b:40","s":"n","t":"那夜他在角桌鋪白紙，收起制符黃紙，特意拿出的白紙。","bg":"jae","tone":"dark","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:41","s":"n","t":"筆蘸墨寫下一個名字，不是閏月，是三年前總寫在住址下的名字。","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":null},{"id":"ep-27b:42","s":"n","t":"墨未乾，字邊已糊，一筆筆如滲進紙裡，最後一筆消失，紙又白了。","im":true,"fx":"ink","sfx":"page","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"ink","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:43","s":"yun","t":"今天有點快啊。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-27b:44","s":"n","t":"再寫，又消失。第三次，他擱筆，把名字念出。"},{"id":"ep-27b:45","s":"n","t":"名字一成聲音，便散入麵包香與爐煙，沒到任何人耳邊。","im":true,"shot":"close","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:46","s":"yun","t":"沒關係。我還記得。","x":"void"},{"id":"ep-27b:47","s":"n","t":"是不是真的沒關係，連他也不知道。只是三年來，他早已非常熟練地學會了說這句話。"},{"id":"ep-27b:48","s":"ln","t":"叔叔，你不睡嗎？","x":"worry","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"void"},"r":{"who":"ln","x":"worry"}},{"id":"ep-27b:49","s":"yun","t":"啊，露娜小姐。醒了？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27b:50","s":"ln","t":"口渴。不過叔叔叫什麼？","x":"worry"},{"id":"ep-27b:50b","s":"ln","t":"姐姐讓我早上問，說新來的客人怎麼一直在。","x":"worry"},{"id":"ep-27b:51","s":"n","t":"他臉僵了一瞬。新客人，這不該是昨日並肩烤麵包的人說的話。"},{"id":"ep-27b:52","s":"yun","t":"閏月，像有又像沒有的閏月，忘了也沒關係的名字。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27b:53","s":"ln","t":"閏月叔叔，記住了！明天告訴姐姐。","x":"cheer"},{"id":"ep-27b:54","s":"yun","t":"謝謝妳。那明天也請再問我一次。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:55","s":"n","t":"露娜打著呵欠回房了。閏月望著她的背影很久。明天早上，這孩子也會再問一次。叔叔叫什麼名字？"},{"id":"ep-27b:56","s":"n","t":"他開門出巷，仰望天空。黑月退去處，天縫合了，卻未完全合攏。","bg":"jae","tone":"desat","bgm":"starDrift","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":null,"scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-27b:57","s":"n","t":"縫中漏出不屬這世界的星光，陌生星排成十二行，每行嵌一顆無名大星。","im":true,"fx":"stars","sfx":"chime","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:58","s":"yun","t":"另一片天啊。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-27b:59","s":"n","t":"掌洞自行朝星光牽引。從生出那日起，洞總朝黑月所在方向傾斜。"},{"id":"ep-27b:60","s":"yun","t":"原來在那裡。吃掉我時間的那傢伙的主人。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-27b:61","s":"n","t":"他把手套重新緊緊套在繃帶上。"},{"id":"ep-27b:62","s":"yun","t":"小姐用了符就會回來。她忘不了麵包的味道。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-27b:63","s":"yun","t":"那我先去占個位子。合婚攤位，地段很重要的。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-27b:64","s":"yun","t":"貓先生又該吃醋了。不過，這也有助於生意。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-27b:65","s":"n","t":"次晨姐姐開店，角桌已沒人。筆旁白紙，什麼也沒寫。","im":true,"shot":"quiet","scene":{"background":"jae","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: jae","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"jae 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-27b:66","s":"lns","t":"誰把紙落在這兒了？","x":"tired"},{"id":"ep-27b:67","s":"n","t":"露娜的姊姊把紙摺好，放進抽屜，沒有丟掉。為什麼這麼做，她自己也不知道。"}]}
